Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:52:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Reuse duplicate lifecycle substitution token
 readings

Deduplicate identical preprocessed readings per nesting level and memoize repeated substitution bodies per traversal and depth budget. Preserve distinct ANSI-C evidence, occurrence order, fresh mutable results and depth-limit refusal.

Proof: 54 lifecycle suites / 9665 tests pass; full heredoc corpus 30852 cases, violations=0 false_refusals=0. Two new regressions fail on baseline; all six pass with fix. scripts/check --base origin/main passes. Five-sample full-scan medians before/after: 800 lines 1.855/1.478s; one-liner 4.012/3.549ms; 50x20 deep 4.830/2.140s.
